          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78058,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos aprender um novo conceito que explica como as variáveis acompanham coisas como adicionar ou remover dólares de uma carteira.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    /* Green */&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Wallet: &lt;strong&gt;$&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Add $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Remove $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let wallet = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById('amount');&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    wallet += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    wallet -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 78057,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando criamos uma variável, nós <strong>atribuímos</strong> a ela um valor, como atribuir <code>3</code> a <code>wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando criamos uma variável, nós <strong>atribuímos</strong> um valor a ela. Atribua um valor a <code>wallet</code> para o código exibir <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78056,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Atribuição a si mesmo</strong> é quando definimos uma variável para o seu próprio valor. Por exemplo, podemos definir <code>wallet</code> para o seu valor <code>3</code> com <code>wallet = wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>wallet</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A <strong>auto-atribuição</strong> atribui à variável o próprio valor. Monte a segunda linha para <code>wallet</code> manter o valor e o código exibir <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>wallet</code> e finalmente <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78055,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos auto-atribuir variáveis, podemos aumentar ou diminuir variáveis definidas como números. Tente aumentar <code>wallet</code> com <code>wallet = wallet + 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A auto-atribuição permite alterar um número. Aumente <code>wallet</code> em um para o código exibir <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet - 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet + 3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78053,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variáveis auto-atribuídas nos permitem rastrear dados que mudam ao longo do tempo. Por exemplo, um usuário pode adicionar <code>2</code> dólares a uma carteira e depois remover <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>2</code> seguido de <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A auto-atribuição permite rastrear um valor que muda. Começando em <code>3</code>, some <code>2</code> e depois subtraia <code>1</code> para exibir <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+</code> seguido de <code>-</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78054,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variáveis definidas como strings funcionam da mesma maneira. Tente definir <code>name</code> como <code>name + \" John\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Account name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Elton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Account name:  Elton John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Assigning a value",
            "id": 78052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que valor este código atribui à variável <code>speed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma condição posterior verifica <code>speed == 0</code>. Com base nesta atribuição, o que essa comparação retorna?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code>, porque <code>speed</code> armazena <code>0</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code>, porque <code>speed</code> armazena o próprio nome.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um erro, porque <code>0</code> não pode ser atribuído a uma variável.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True</code>, porque <code>speed</code> armazena <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código ainda exibe <code>100</code> depois da segunda atribuição?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A segunda atribuição armazena novamente em <code>speed</code> o valor atual de <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Atribuir uma variável a ela mesma redefine a variável para seu primeiro valor.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O Python ignora toda atribuição que usa a mesma variável nos dois lados.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A segunda atribuição armazena novamente em <code>speed</code> o valor atual de <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como a segunda linha faz o console exibir <code>101</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ela lê <code>100</code>, soma <code>1</code> e armazena <code>101</code> em <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ela une os dígitos <code>100</code> e <code>1</code> e armazena <code>1001</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ela calcula <code>101</code>, mas mantém <code>100</code> armazenado em <code>speed</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ela lê <code>100</code>, soma <code>1</code> e armazena <code>101</code> em <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78063,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que a auto-atribuição é um conceito de programação tão poderoso?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque nos permite rastrear dados que mudam ao longo do tempo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque isso nos ajuda a criar comparações</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque nos permite rastrear dados que mudam ao longo do tempo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A auto-atribuição é poderosa porque permite rastrear dados que mudam ao longo do tempo.</p><p>Um jogo soma <code>points</code> ao <code>score</code> atual após cada rodada. Qual linha rastreia o novo total?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score = score + points</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>score == score + points</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>score = points</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>score = score + points</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Rowling Joanne</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>Joanne Rowling</code> em vez de <code>Rowling Joanne</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O nome atual está à esquerda de <code>+</code>, então o novo texto é adicionado depois dele.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A atribuição substitui o nome antigo antes de unir as duas strings.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A auto-atribuição move automaticamente o novo texto para o final, independentemente da ordem dos operandos.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O nome atual está à esquerda de <code>+</code>, então o novo texto é adicionado depois dele.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
