        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como a autoatribuição é uma ferramenta poderosa para construir programas, vamos aprender alguns operadores que nos ajudam a escrever código mais rapidamente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sabemos que podemos adicionar <code>1</code> a uma variável escrevendo o nome da variável. Neste caso, vamos adicionar um ao <code>likes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes = likes + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>likes</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "+= operator",
            "id": 78240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em vez de reescrever o nome da variável, podemos usar o operador <code>+=</code> para adicionar um número com <code>sales += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sales</code> seguido de <code>+=</code> e finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em vez de reescrever o nome da variável, o operador <code>+=</code> soma um número em uma etapa. Use-o para o código exibir <code>6</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sales</code> seguido de <code>+=</code> e finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "-= operator",
            "id": 78232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para subtrair do valor de uma variável, usamos o operador <code>-=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: += operator",
            "id": 78220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual atribuição mais longa atualizaria <code>marbles</code> da mesma forma que a segunda linha?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>marbles = marbles + 2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = 2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = marbles - 2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>marbles = marbles + 2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: -= operator",
            "id": 78229,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual operador usamos para subtrair um número do valor de uma variável?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O operador <code>-=</code> subtrai um número do valor de uma variável e armazena o resultado.</p><p>Você escreve <code>lives - 1</code>, mas <code>lives</code> não muda. Qual substituição subtrai um e armazena o resultado?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>lives -= 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives += 1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives = 1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>lives -= 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual operador adiciona ao valor de uma variável?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>-</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O operador <code>+=</code> soma ao valor de uma variável e armazena o resultado.</p><p>A variável <code>coins</code> armazena <code>7</code>. Qual linha muda o valor dela para <code>12</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>coins += 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>coins = 5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>coins + 5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>coins += 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 78215,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>199</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>speed -= 1</code> subtrai <code>1</code> de <code>200</code> e armazena o resultado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> soma 1 a 200 e armazena 201.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> substitui 200 por 1.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>speed -= 1</code> subtrai <code>1</code> de <code>200</code> e armazena o resultado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
